  - lattice polyhedra
abstract: >-
  An explicit homogeneous convex polyhedron with fourteen integer-coordinate
  vertices, thirty-six edges and twenty-four triangular facets has exactly two
  stable, one saddle and one unstable equilibrium about its volume centroid.
  Every positive vertical contraction by a factor at most one remains
  mono-unstable. The archive supplies the manuscript, coordinates, exact
  verification programs, reports and a standard-library reproduction command.
